### Ingress routes

{% if routes %}
Routes:
{% for route in routes -%}
- {{ route.host }}{{ route.path }} - { service: {{ route.service }}, entrypoints: {{ route.entrypoints | join(', ') | default('—', true) }}, middlewares: {{ route.middlewares | join(', ') | default('—', true) }} | {{ route.tls | default('—', true) }} }
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
IngressRoute objects reported.
{% endif %}

{% else %}
This is awkward... there's not much you can do here because it's a 'worker' node. Visit the 'controller' node to see what's going on.
{% endif %}
